  "RP2040 Datasheet, build-date 2025-02-20, build-version 3184e62 (RP-008371-DS-1), https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/rp2040/rp2040-datasheet.pdf, read 2026-10-31",
  "pin numbers and names: the KiCad symbol MCU_RaspberryPi:RP2040 as the Corne's schematic places it (pin 57 the exposed pad) – the same numbers as figure 3 and tables 615–621",
